    "The slot lock: which agent works in this worktree (a worker slot), so that two agents never share one.\n"
    "\n"
    "    slot_lock [--root DIR] take    --agent ID [--note TEXT] [--force]   claim the slot (again: refresh it)\n"
    "    slot_lock status                                       who holds the slot, live or stale\n"
    "    slot_lock release --agent ID | --force                 give the slot back\n"
    "\n"
    "The lock is the file `.slot_lock` at the top of the worktree (ignored by git, never versioned): the agent, the\n"
    "branch checked out when it was taken, the start time, the last time a tool ran under it (the heartbeat), the\n"
    "host and a note. The agent is --agent, else $SLOT_AGENT: a name the coordinator gives the worker (`r19-w1a`),\n"
    "not the session, which every agent of one session shares. The worktree is --root, else $DECOMPKIT_ROOT, else\n"
    "the checkout the executable is in.\n"
    "\n"
    "  take     writes the lock. When another agent's live lock holds the slot it refuses (exit 1) and prints the holder:\n"
    "           pick another slot, or ask whoever runs the round (--force takes it anyway). Taking it again under the\n"
    "           same agent (a resumed agent) refreshes it and records the branch now checked out.\n"
    "  status   the holder, its branch (and the branch checked out now when it differs), its age, its heartbeat; exit 0\n"
    "           when the slot is free or stale, 1 when a live lock holds it.\n"
    "  release  removes the lock when --agent is its holder (--force: whoever holds it).\n"
    "\n"
    "Advisory and crash-safe: nothing is ever blocked but `take`. A lock whose heartbeat is older than $SLOT_LOCK_TTL\n"
    "hours (default 6) is stale: an agent that crashed or ended without a release; `take` replaces it with a line.\n"
    "A tool of the worktree may call dk_slot_warn() on start: one `WARNING: slot lock:` line when the branch checked\n"
    "out is not the lock's branch (another agent may have switched it) or when $SLOT_AGENT names another agent than\n"
    "the holder; otherwise it refreshes the heartbeat. A worktree without a lock gets no line.\n"
